          "Item-level lyric authorship remains unresolved; the film-level `பாடல்கள்: கவிஞர் வாலி` credit is not promoted to this occurrence."
        ],
        "english_lines": [
          "The water-bearing cloud",
          "came down to the earth;",
          "the earth she bore",
          "cooled and settled;",
          "in the flower of a crore petals",
          "all the nectar steeped —",
          "before and behind,",
          "gleaming — in a golden",
          "river of milk, in bliss,",
          "she bathed!"
        ]
      }
    },
